<p class="0 0 0 center 1 0" just="left">
<b>ELECTORAL (AMENDMENT) ACT 2014</b>
</p>

<p class="0 6 4 center 1 0" just="left"><hr1/>
</p>
<p class="2 10 0 left 1 0">An Act to amend the Electoral Act 1992 and the European Parliament Elections Act 1997; and to provide for related matters.</p>
<p class="2 10 0 left 1 0" just="left">[16 <i>th April</i>, 2014]</p>
<p class="-1 16 0 left 1 0"><b>Be it enacted by the Oireachtas as follows:</b></p>
</frontmatter>
<body>
<sect id="SEC1">
<number>1.</number><title>
<p class="0 8 0 left 1 0" just="left"><b>Amendment of Electoral Act 1992</b></p>
</title>
<p class="0 0 0 justify 0 0" just="left"></p>
<p class="-3 11 0 left 0 0" just="left"><b>1.</b> The Electoral Act 1992 is amended<emdash/></p>
<p class="-3 15 0 left 1 0" just="left">(a) in section 41<emdash/></p>
<p class="2 10 0 left 1 0" just="left">(i) in paragraph (j), by deleting <odq/>or<cdq/>, and</p>
<p class="2 10 0 left 1 0" just="left">(ii) by repealing paragraph (k), </p>
<p class="-3 15 0 left 1 0" just="left">and</p>
<p class="-3 15 0 left 1 0" just="left">(b) in section 42<emdash/></p>
<p class="2 10 0 left 1 0" just="left">(i) in subsection (1), by substituting <odq/>subsection (2) <cdq/> for <odq/>subsections (2) and (3) <cdq/>,</p>
<p class="2 10 0 left 1 0" just="left">(ii) by repealing subsection (3), and</p>
<p class="2 10 0 left 1 0" just="left">(iii) in subsection (4), by deleting <odq/>or (3) <cdq/>.</p>
</sect>

<sect id="SEC2">
<number>2.</number><title>
<p class="0 8 0 left 1 0" just="left"><b>Amendment of European Parliament Elections Act 1997</b></p>
</title>
<p class="0 0 0 justify 0 0" just="left"></p>
<p class="-3 11 0 left 0 0" just="left"><b>2.</b> Section 11 of the European Parliament Elections Act 1997 is amended in subsection (2) (a) by substituting <odq/>paragraphs (f) to (j) <cdq/> for <odq/>paragraphs (f) to (k) <cdq/>.</p>
</sect>

<sect id="SEC3">
<number>3.</number><title>
<p class="0 8 0 left 1 0" just="left"><b>Short title, construction and collective citations</b></p>
</title>
<p class="-3 11 0 left 0 0" just="left"><b>3. </b>(1) This Act may be cited as the Electoral (Amendment) Act 2014.</p>
<p class="-3 13 0 left 1 0" just="left">(2) This Act shall be included in the collective citation <odq/>Electoral Acts 1992 to 2014<cdq/> and shall be read together as one with those Acts.</p>
<p class="-3 13 0 left 1 0" just="left">(3) This Act (in so far as it relates to European Parliament elections) shall be included in the collective citation <odq/>European Parliament Elections Acts 1992 to 2014<cdq/> and shall (in so far as it so relates) be read together as one with those Acts.</p>
</sect>
</body>
